1
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,319
Who are you?

2
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:51,159
We're from China's Zhong'an. Here's my ID.

3
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,400
Zhong'an. I've heard of you.

4
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,519
What's the situation now?

5
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,400
We've already sent someone in to negotiate.

6
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,400
No word yet.

7
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,519
Stay calm. Let's see how things play out first.

8
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:37,479
Shen Yu, do you know the area you're crossing

9
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,439
is a warzone between government forces and terrorists?

10
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,159
Something this dangerous,

11
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:40,960
why didn't you talk to us

12
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,800
before acting on your own?

13
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,400
Don't worry, Xiao Bei.

14
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,919
Just focus on rescuing our people.

15
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:47,719
We'll all make it back safe and sound.

16
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,319
All right, just be careful out there.

17
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:52,039
Something just came up on our end.

18
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:53,039
We'll be in touch later.

19
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,319
Okay, stay safe.

20
00:02:54,719 --> 00:02:55,599
See you at the hotel.

21
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,400
How did it go?

22
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:03,159
Chief, their demands haven't changed.

23
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,439
They want us to withdraw our troops

24
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,759
and halt the assault on José City.

25
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,360
They're also demanding the Chinese government

26
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,319
intervene in our counteroffensive.

27
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,919
How are the hostages doing?

28
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,120
Most of them are hanging in there.

29
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:14,240
A few elderly ones seem pretty weak.

30
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,360
Can we negotiate with them first

31
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,599
to let some of the weaker

32
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,400
hostages go?

33
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:19,639
I already brought it up,

34
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:20,719
but they refused.

35
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:24,039
Are we just going to sit here and do nothing?

36
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,120
What, you want to just charge in?

37
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,159
Are you okay?

38
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,919
Hang in there a little longer.

39
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,639
Please, save my father!

40
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,680
He has a bad heart.

41
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,520
No way.

42
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:46,400
Until our demands are met,

43
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,599
none of you are leaving.

44
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,599
You'd better pray

45
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:50,000
that your government intervenes.

46
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,560
If they abandon you,

47
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,240
then none of you will make it out.

48
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,639
Helen, is everything okay at the hotel?

49
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,000
Everything's fine.

50
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,840
We just rescued a pregnant woman.

51
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,439
It's just that the hotel

52
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:08,039
has completely run out of anesthetics.

53
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,759
Just hang in there a bit longer.

54
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:12,120
I'll reach the port in two hours.

55
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,759
Shen Yu.

56
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,199
Go ahead.

57
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,519
I'm coming to find you right now.

58
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:20,240
No.

59
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:23,120
You're needed at the hotel.

60
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,120
An Da is here at the hotel.

61
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,959
It'll be fine for now.

62
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,519
No, I'm almost at the combat zone.

63
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:30,120
It's too dangerous here.

64
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:31,519
Then stop right

65
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,519
at the edge of the combat zone!

66
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:34,839
Send me your location. I'm heading over.

67
00:04:34,839 --> 00:04:35,639
No, Helen.

68
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,040
Listen to me.

69
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,759
The situation here really is...

70
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Helen?

71
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,360
Damn it, Helen...

72
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,480
Consul Wu.

73
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:57,920
Hello, Consul Wu.

74
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,480
I'm from Zhong'an Security Group,

75
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,839
Xiang Bei, head of the Supedo branch.

76
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:02,560
Let me introduce you.

77
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,879
This is Antilocaris's Police Chief,

78
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:06,279
Mr. Ham.

79
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:06,959
Hello.

80
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,600
Xiang, what's the situation inside?

81
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,560
Negotiations haven't made any progress.

82
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:15,759
And we heard

83
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,000
two elderly hostages

84
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,120
are having health issues.

85
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:20,839
Can we get the two elderly hostages

86
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,759
released first?

87
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,800
We proposed that,

88
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,920
but the kidnappers refused.

89
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:27,560
Consul Wu, let me just

90
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,040
plan an assault.

91
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,000
Let's not rush.

92
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:32,439
What if our citizens inside get hurt?

93
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,920
Let's find another way.

94
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,360
If the kidnappers get desperate,

95
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,879
the hostages' safety will be compromised.

96
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,959
There are more police out there.

97
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:43,720
Looks like the Chinese sent people over.

98
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,600
The same crew we saw last night.

99
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:48,800
The local police, not wanting to cross the Chinese,

100
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,279
won't dare launch a reckless attack.

101
00:05:51,519 --> 00:05:53,439
It's the Chinese security firms we should worry about.

102
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,839
They always have

103
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,839
plenty of unexpected tricks up their sleeve.

104
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:58,639
Tell HQ we need backup.

105
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,439
Copy that.

106
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:02,000
Commander,

107
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,360
our men at the estate church reported

108
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,120
the government brought in heavy police reinforcements.

109
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,759
And... and...

110
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,800
And what?

111
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,160
And the Chinese sent operatives from Zhong'an.

112
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,439
Our men are surrounded

113
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,600
and requesting backup.

114
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,759
Call in Hades.

115
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,600
Yes, sir.

116
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,160
How is he?

117
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,439
Long-term drug injections

118
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:33,000
caused physical dysfunction.

119
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,560
He's in no immediate danger for now.

120
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,319
Then stop injecting him for now.

121
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,000
Wei Tian.

122
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,600
Never thought you'd end up like this.

123
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,000
I'd love to stick around and play,

124
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,920
but your fellow Chinese citizens

125
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,879
are leaving Antilocaris now.

126
00:06:57,839 --> 00:06:59,920
I need to do something for them.

127
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,120
You two, watch him.

128
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:08,240
Whatever you do, don't let him die.

129
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,839
Goodbye.

130
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:33,639
Sir.

131
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,000
Hades.

132
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:39,199
I need your special combat unit.

133
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:41,959
Zhong'an's men have arrived at the estate.

134
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,120
We must ensure

135
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,720
a balance of forces between both sides.

136
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,120
I'm heading over right now.

137
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:47,920
Don't worry.

138
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:51,560
Very good, Hades. Very good.

139
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:58,839
Since Zhong'an's people are there,

140
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:00,279
is Qu Shengli there too?

141
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:01,279
Yes, Boss.

142
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:03,120
Deploy the special combat unit.

143
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:06,000
Wipe out everyone inside the estate.

144
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,439
What about the Chinese hostages?

145
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:09,439
I want those hostages dead.

146
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:11,279
Then the Chinese government

147
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,759
will pin the blame on Walter.

148
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:15,680
Keeping Supedo in constant chaos

149
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:18,439
is what our backers want to see most.

150
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,720
By the way, that Wei Tian...

151
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,879
How is he doing now?

152
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:23,399
We're still regularly injecting him with drugs.

153
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,680
Very good.

154
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:36,320
Helen, you're really something.

155
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:39,799
You forgot something.

156
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,919
Why did you bring my passport?

157
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:46,960
See for yourself.

158
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,240
"When you encounter danger abroad,

159
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,320
do not give up.

160
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:52,320
Remember that behind you,

161
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,919
stands a powerful motherland."

162
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,759
No matter what happens,

163
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,559
this passport is our talisman.

164
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,960
But do you have any idea

165
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,919
how dangerous it is here?

166
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,639
Well, on my way here,

167
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:05,039
I didn't run into any danger.

168
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,000
That's because you haven't entered the war zone yet.

169
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,559
Turn around and go back right now.

170
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:10,039
I'm not leaving.

171
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,519
If I leave,

172
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:14,320
what happens to the supplies if you get into trouble?

173
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,360
Don't worry.

174
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,919
Even if it costs my life,

175
00:10:17,039 --> 00:10:18,799
I will keep these supplies safe.

176
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,120
Shen Yu.

177
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,559
Do you really think

178
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,720
it's just the supplies I'm worried about?

179
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:24,919
Don't worry.

180
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,600
With old partners like us together,

181
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,960
no matter how dangerous it gets ahead,

182
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,919
we'll be fine.

183
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:31,360
Besides, my motorcycle is out of gas.

184
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,320
I need a ride.

185
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,559
Guess I can't shake you off.

186
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,720
By the way, when you left,

187
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,080
was there any news from Xiao Bei?

188
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,840
Not yet.

189
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,039
But supplies and medicine at the hotel

190
00:10:43,039 --> 00:10:44,279
are running critically low.

191
00:10:44,559 --> 00:10:46,200
We have to retrieve the supplies quickly.

192
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:49,200
Remember, the more critical the situation,

193
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,519
the less careless we can afford to be.

194
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,919
Movement over there.

195
00:11:00,399 --> 00:11:01,519
Who are those people?

196
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,720
Those look like terrorist vehicles.

197
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:06,519
Where do you think they're going?

198
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,240
The port.

199
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,240
We need to hurry.

200
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,720
We have to beat them there.

201
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,519
Let's go.

202
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,120
Consul Wu, we can't delay this any longer.

203
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,960
I request permission to infiltrate from the flank.

204
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,000
Completely unarmed.

205
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,840
That way, we won't provoke the hostage-takers.

206
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,039
What do you think?

207
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,519
I think it's worth a shot.

208
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,000
All right. Operation approved.

209
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:41,639
Yes, sir.

210
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,879
Then remember this:

211
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,279
you must guarantee the safety of the hostages.

212
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:44,919
Understood.

213
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:45,919
Move out.

214
00:11:45,919 --> 00:11:46,559
Right.

215
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,919
Mr. Ham,

216
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,799
why are there two armored vehicles?

217
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:06,639
Could be backup for the attackers.

218
00:12:06,639 --> 00:12:08,440
They're trying to enter the estate from the flank.

219
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,519
See that? Two armored vehicles.

220
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,279
I see them.

221
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,559
It's Hades.

222
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,120
It's Hades' men.

223
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:31,600
Our backup is here!

224
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,639
Great!

225
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,600
Damn it! Protect the hostages!

226
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,519
Where's that gunfire coming from?

227
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,919
Did the thugs who rushed in start shooting?

228
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,840
Looks like things are getting out of hand.

229
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,960
Go save them, now!

230
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,039
Ensure the Chinese hostages' safety at all costs!

231
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,559
Yes, sir! Move, move, move!

232
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,759
Move, hurry!

233
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,360
Hades is going to kill every last one of us!

234
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,240
Don't panic, everyone!

235
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,519
I'll get you all out of here!

236
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:49,799
The cops are storming in! Let's fall back!

237
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,720
Hurry, fall back! Fall back!

238
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,679
Let's go, everyone. It's safe now.

239
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,320
Let's go, let's go.

240
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,200
Everyone, head outside.

241
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,399
Quick, get up! Get up!

242
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,919
Up, up, up! Move, move, move!

243
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,720
They're out! They're coming out!

244
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,279
Fellow citizens, you've been through so much.

245
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,600
Watch your step, be careful.

246
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:32,440
Thank the government!

247
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,600
Thank you, thank you!

248
00:14:33,879 --> 00:14:35,159
This way. Take it easy.

249
00:14:35,159 --> 00:14:36,440
Head to the safe area.

250
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,320
Where's Xiang Bei?

251
00:14:39,039 --> 00:14:40,039
He's on his way.

252
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:42,000
Xiang Bei, are you okay?

253
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:42,879
I'm fine.

254
00:14:42,879 --> 00:14:43,519
Good.

255
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,320
Hades sent two truckloads of men,

256
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,519
but we fought them off.

257
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,600
That was a close call. A real close call.

258
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,600
Great job, both of you. Great job.

259
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:53,679
Just doing our job.

260
00:14:59,799 --> 00:15:00,600
Shen Yu!

261
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:03,120
They turned around and are heading right for us!

262
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,159
They're catching up!

263
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,159
It never ends!

264
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,440
Helen, quick, drop the spike strips!

265
00:15:50,519 --> 00:15:51,320
On it!

266
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:18,919
They're gaining on us!

267
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:21,919
What do we do now?

268
00:16:22,519 --> 00:16:24,000
Cast the net. Let's catch some fish.

269
00:16:35,799 --> 00:16:38,000
It's okay. We still have one more chance.

270
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,080
I'll find an opening to get close.

271
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:39,720
Pick the right moment!

272
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,360
Got it.

273
00:16:43,799 --> 00:16:44,919
Alright, do it now!

274
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,759
Who knew the rockets meant for us...

275
00:16:56,799 --> 00:16:58,039
...would be used on themselves?

276
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,200
That's great!

277
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,160
Hades, what the hell happened?

278
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,160
Why were so many of my men killed or wounded,

279
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,519
and all the rest captured?

280
00:17:16,519 --> 00:17:18,240
Care to explain this to me?

281
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:20,400
Bullets have no eyes in war.

282
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:23,359
Once the shooting starts, anything can happen.

283
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,039
If I find out

284
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:28,079
you're plotting schemes behind my back,

285
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,519
I'll make you pay dearly.

286
00:17:29,519 --> 00:17:31,400
I'll twist off your head with my bare hands

287
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,000
and kick it like a ball.

288
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,000
Don't worry.

289
00:17:36,279 --> 00:17:38,079
I value my own life very much.

290
00:18:02,119 --> 00:18:02,960
Come on, hurry, hurry!

291
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:03,720
We're here, we're here!

292
00:18:03,759 --> 00:18:05,640
Careful, be careful!

293
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,319
Got it, got it.

294
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:07,559
Quick, hurry!

295
00:18:10,359 --> 00:18:12,240
Doctor! Doctor, come quickly! Doctor!

296
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:17,680
How is he?

297
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:20,000
The injuries are critical. He needs surgery right away.

298
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:20,960
How much anesthetic do we have left?

299
00:18:21,559 --> 00:18:24,039
We're almost out of anesthetic, and gauze too.

300
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:25,640
Should we use painkillers first?

301
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,559
That's our only option right now.

302
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:29,519
Hurry, hurry! Over there!

303
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,920
Come on, take it easy, slow down.

304
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,519
Quick, we have an elderly patient here!

305
00:18:35,519 --> 00:18:37,400
Extremely weak, needs urgent treatment!

306
00:18:37,559 --> 00:18:38,640
Um, Doctor...

307
00:18:38,759 --> 00:18:39,359
Doctor!

308
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:40,079
Doctor!

309
00:18:40,839 --> 00:18:41,519
Leave them to us.

310
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:42,039
Okay, okay.

311
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:43,480
Easy now.

312
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:45,440
Aren't Shen Yu and the others back yet?

313
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:47,240
Not yet. Helen went too.

314
00:18:47,559 --> 00:18:48,759
Why did Helen go as well?

315
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,079
She was worried about Shen Yu going alone,

316
00:18:51,079 --> 00:18:52,720
so she rode over there.

317
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,960
When do you think they'll be back?

318
00:18:55,119 --> 00:18:56,200
Too many people are injured at the manor.

319
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,200
They need a lot of medical supplies.

320
00:18:57,279 --> 00:18:58,720
Don't worry, I just got word.

321
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,400
They're on their way, almost here.

322
00:19:00,839 --> 00:19:01,640
That's good.

323
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:02,960
By the way, Song Xue.

324
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:04,240
Consul Wu from the consulate has arrived.

325
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,119
Go and receive him.

326
00:19:05,119 --> 00:19:06,440
Okay, I'll go right now.

327
00:19:09,039 --> 00:19:10,200
Why aren't they here yet?

328
00:19:10,599 --> 00:19:12,680
We have a guest with severe diabetes.

329
00:19:12,839 --> 00:19:13,720
He's extremely weak.

330
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,720
Right after I took him to the restaurant to eat,

331
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,039
he had an attack immediately.

332
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:19,519
He urgently needs an insulin injection.

333
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,039
We're just waiting on them.

334
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,680
ID.

335
00:19:49,119 --> 00:19:50,519
We're here to pick up supplies.

336
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:57,799
Let's go.

337
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:10,440
Hello.

338
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:10,799
Hello.

339
00:20:10,799 --> 00:20:12,319
I'm Helen from Zhong'an Group.

340
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:14,240
I'm here to collect the supplies.

341
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:17,240
Here's our pickup permit.

342
00:20:20,279 --> 00:20:21,759
These supplies from back home...

343
00:20:21,759 --> 00:20:23,559
have been held up here for quite some time.

344
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:26,200
The military junta has been eyeing them.

345
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,720
If you hadn't come for them soon,

346
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,599
we really couldn't have kept them safe.

347
00:20:29,599 --> 00:20:31,240
We really need these supplies,

348
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,960
but the route cuts through active war zones.

349
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:35,599
That's why no one dared to come before.

350
00:20:35,599 --> 00:20:36,279
Indeed.

351
00:20:36,279 --> 00:20:38,039
Who else would have the guts

352
00:20:38,039 --> 00:20:39,119
to cross a war zone?

353
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:40,839
Consul Wu told me

354
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,880
a friend from Zhong'an would be coming.

355
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:43,960
So it was you all along.

356
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:45,920
Not me. Him.

357
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,519
And this is...?

358
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,839
I'm Shen Yu from Zhong'an.

359
00:20:50,079 --> 00:20:51,960
I was originally the one assigned to pick up the supplies.

360
00:20:52,119 --> 00:20:53,400
Helen just hitched a ride with me.

361
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,920
As long as you arrived safely.

362
00:20:56,079 --> 00:20:57,400
The supplies are all loaded up.

363
00:20:57,559 --> 00:20:58,359
This way, please.

364
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:00,240
Great, thanks. Let's go.

365
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:00,920
After you.

366
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:45,960
We can't let him die.

367
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,480
Watch him. I'll get help.

368
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:49,359
Okay.

369
00:22:06,039 --> 00:22:06,839
By the way, Helen,

370
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,400
there's an old friend of yours here

371
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:09,559
who wants to head back with you.

372
00:22:09,759 --> 00:22:10,559
An old friend?

373
00:22:11,319 --> 00:22:12,519
Who are you talking about?

374
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:14,279
His Majesty King José Limón.

375
00:22:22,599 --> 00:22:23,480
Your Majesty.

376
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,240
Hello.

377
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,079
Good to see you again.

378
00:22:25,079 --> 00:22:26,119
Good to see you again.

379
00:22:26,279 --> 00:22:27,799
Didn't you already go to the neighboring country?

380
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:30,279
I just escorted my family to the neighboring country.

381
00:22:30,519 --> 00:22:33,920
Helen, would you come back

382
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:35,400
to Antilocaris with me?

383
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,000
Of course.

384
00:22:37,279 --> 00:22:38,400
We're heading to the Grand Plato.

385
00:22:38,519 --> 00:22:39,559
Where are you headed?

386
00:22:40,039 --> 00:22:42,680
There happens to be a hotel nearby.

387
00:22:42,759 --> 00:22:44,559
I'm meeting my trusted aides there.

388
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:48,319
Then we'll return to Antilocaris together.

389
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,319
Manager Song, thank you.

390
00:22:52,319 --> 00:22:54,000
You're welcome. Stay safe on the road.

391
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:54,480
Take care.

392
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:55,160
Take care.

393
00:22:56,839 --> 00:22:57,559
Until we meet again.

394
00:22:57,559 --> 00:22:58,279
Goodbye.

395
00:22:58,960 --> 00:22:59,759
Follow me.

396
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:00,759
Let's go.

397
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:01,920
Goodbye.

398
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,640
Goodbye.

399
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:07,559
Thank you.

400
00:23:29,759 --> 00:23:30,559
Stop the vehicle!

401
00:23:37,079 --> 00:23:40,119
Sir, you only had one vehicle when you came in.

402
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:43,960
We're here to retrieve these supplies.

403
00:23:44,119 --> 00:23:45,200
Here are our documents.

404
00:23:48,039 --> 00:23:48,920
I'm sorry.

405
00:23:49,119 --> 00:23:50,680
We just received orders.

406
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:53,000
You cannot take these supplies.

407
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:54,079
Why?

408
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:55,920
This is aid from the Chinese government

409
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:57,319
sent to assist the refugees.

410
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,680
On what grounds are you seizing it?

411
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,920
Let me speak with them.

412
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:00,640
No.

413
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,039
They have a warrant out for you right now.

414
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:04,359
You can't go. It's too dangerous.

415
00:24:04,359 --> 00:24:06,480
He's right. It's too dangerous.

416
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:07,319
It's fine.

417
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:08,880
Open the door.

418
00:24:18,119 --> 00:24:19,920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

419
00:24:20,799 --> 00:24:22,119
Did you assume

420
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:24,400
I had already fled to a neighboring country?

421
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:26,920
Let me tell you, I will never leave.

422
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:29,720
Especially now, while our nation is undergoing reform,

423
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:31,279
I have even less reason to leave.

424
00:24:31,599 --> 00:24:32,720
I will remain here,

425
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,160
standing with my people.

426
00:24:34,559 --> 00:24:36,519
Do you know what's inside this vehicle?

427
00:24:37,519 --> 00:24:40,599
Urgent medicine, vital to countless lives.

428
00:24:40,839 --> 00:24:43,359
Are you truly going to seize it?

429
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:46,559
Forgive us, Your Majesty. We were wrong.

430
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,279
Let them through!

431
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:24,119
Everyone, you've suffered so much here.

432
00:25:25,519 --> 00:25:26,759
Please rest assured,

433
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:28,119
our government

434
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:30,559
has always cared deeply about your situation.

435
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:34,799
Today, representing our government at Grand Plato Hotel,

436
00:25:35,279 --> 00:25:36,480
I've come to visit you all.

437
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:39,759
If you have any requests, please feel free to tell me.

438
00:25:41,119 --> 00:25:41,920
Furthermore,

439
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:44,400
I have some great news to share.

440
00:25:44,519 --> 00:25:47,680
The chartered flight sent from home to bring you back

441
00:25:48,039 --> 00:25:49,799
has already entered African airspace.

442
00:25:50,119 --> 00:25:53,160
It will soon touch down at the airport

443
00:25:53,599 --> 00:25:55,119
to take everyone home!

444
00:25:56,240 --> 00:25:57,039
Great!

445
00:25:58,039 --> 00:26:01,079
Long live our motherland! Long live our motherland!

446
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:11,000
Your Majesty,

447
00:26:11,680 --> 00:26:12,759
seeing how confident you are,

448
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:14,319
returning to Antilocaris,

449
00:26:14,319 --> 00:26:15,680
you must have a plan in mind?

450
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,920
You're very sharp.

451
00:26:19,519 --> 00:26:20,880
My return this time

452
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:24,759
is to confer with a few loyal subordinates

453
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:27,559
on how to completely repel Walter

454
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:30,480
and stabilize the domestic situation.

455
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,279
Your Majesty,

456
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,759
you truly are a good leader.

457
00:26:34,759 --> 00:26:36,119
I'll always support you.

458
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:43,720
I just can't bear to see my people suffer.

459
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:47,119
With the political turmoil in the José region,

460
00:26:47,519 --> 00:26:52,519
I've always advocated resolving issues through dialogue.

461
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:57,000
Yet there are always people who don't understand me,

462
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:59,319
treating me like a dictator.

463
00:26:59,519 --> 00:27:00,960
Those who hold the truth

464
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,599
are rarely understood by ordinary people.

465
00:27:03,039 --> 00:27:03,839
Believe me,

466
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:06,519
your vision will be realized sooner or later.

467
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:08,839
Thank you.

468
00:27:39,519 --> 00:27:40,359
See you later.

469
00:27:40,359 --> 00:27:41,119
See you.

470
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,480
Get in.

471
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:07,000
Let's part ways here.

472
00:29:07,119 --> 00:29:07,960
All right.

473
00:29:09,119 --> 00:29:10,240
Antilocaris

474
00:29:10,240 --> 00:29:12,359
used to be a prosperous city.

475
00:29:12,519 --> 00:29:14,759
War has made it so desolate.

476
00:29:15,079 --> 00:29:15,880
That's true.

477
00:29:16,119 --> 00:29:18,359
Even for us at Zhong'an, things have gotten tough here.

478
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,119
No matter the era,

479
00:29:20,119 --> 00:29:21,480
whenever war breaks out,

480
00:29:21,759 --> 00:29:23,480
it's always innocent civilians who suffer.

481
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:24,480
That's true, Helen.

482
00:29:24,799 --> 00:29:26,519
I wanted you to witness with me

483
00:29:26,519 --> 00:29:28,160
the moment Walter is defeated.

484
00:29:28,319 --> 00:29:29,319
But I know

485
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,960
your compatriots still need you at the Grand Plato Hotel.

486
00:29:32,119 --> 00:29:33,720
I hope you and your compatriots

487
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:35,720
won't let this terrorist attack

488
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:38,519
shake your faith in Antilocaris.

489
00:29:38,839 --> 00:29:40,319
Please tell them

490
00:29:40,319 --> 00:29:43,960
that Antilocaris will prosper once again.

491
00:29:45,079 --> 00:29:46,359
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

492
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:48,400
I'll definitely let them know.

493
00:29:50,160 --> 00:29:51,079
I'll be waiting for your good news.

494
00:29:51,079 --> 00:29:51,759
All right.

495
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:52,599
Take care.

496
00:29:52,599 --> 00:29:53,319
Goodbye.

497
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:15,559
Let's go.

498
00:31:11,519 --> 00:31:12,200
You're back.

499
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:14,680
It's so good to see you made it back safe.

500
00:31:15,319 --> 00:31:16,039
How did it go?

501
00:31:16,039 --> 00:31:17,400
Did you run into any trouble on the way?

502
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,160
We managed.

503
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:20,240
We even brought back King José Limón.

504
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:20,720
The King?

505
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:21,079
Yes.

506
00:31:21,079 --> 00:31:21,839
Where is he?

507
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:24,000
His loyalists picked him up as soon as we entered the city.

508
00:31:24,799 --> 00:31:27,119
He's planning a major counteroffensive.

509
00:31:27,519 --> 00:31:28,400
That's wonderful.

510
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:30,799
King José Limón has always been a man of peace.

511
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:32,279
Once he takes control of the situation,

512
00:31:32,279 --> 00:31:33,960
the fighting should be over soon.

513
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,400
All right, let's head inside. Come on.

514
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:36,599
Let's go.

515
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:37,759
We still have a lot of work to do.

516
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:41,759
Come on in, Helen.

517
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:43,519
Consul Wu has been waiting for you.

518
00:31:43,519 --> 00:31:45,039
Good work, Helen.

519
00:31:45,039 --> 00:31:45,759
Long time no see.

520
00:31:45,759 --> 00:31:46,880
Please, have a seat.

521
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:54,880
Helen, what's the situation at the port?

522
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:57,279
After all, air transport capacity is limited.

523
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:59,720
Right now, besides the Grand Plato Hotel,

524
00:32:00,519 --> 00:32:03,960
across Antilocaris and the surrounding areas,

525
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:06,519
many who've lost their homes and families—

526
00:32:06,519 --> 00:32:08,759
our displaced compatriots—need to return home.

527
00:32:09,839 --> 00:32:11,039
Our current plan

528
00:32:11,039 --> 00:32:12,519
is to evacuate citizens through the port.

529
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,400
Right now, the port is still

530
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,880
guarded by government forces,

531
00:32:16,200 --> 00:32:18,359
but the terrorists have already targeted it.

532
00:32:20,799 --> 00:32:23,559
That will make things difficult.

533
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,319
I heard

534
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:28,480
you brought back King José Limón.

535
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:31,359
The King said he's rallying his forces

536
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:32,519
for a major counteroffensive.

537
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:33,519
That's great.

538
00:32:34,279 --> 00:32:36,519
The King has always advocated peace.

539
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,960
If he succeeds,

540
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:41,480
the fighting will definitely ease up.

541
00:33:01,319 --> 00:33:02,119
Don't move.

542
00:33:06,519 --> 00:33:07,880
Hand over your phone.

543
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:10,559
Hand over your phone!

544
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:22,000
Come on, lend a hand. Lend a hand.

545
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:23,680
This is great, Master Qu.

546
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,200
With all this flour,

547
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:27,079
our people won't have to go hungry.

548
00:33:27,920 --> 00:33:30,559
Look, don't just think about noodles.

549
00:33:30,599 --> 00:33:32,119
We'll treat everyone later

550
00:33:32,119 --> 00:33:33,359
and make some steamed buns or something.

551
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,319
Speaking of making noodles,

552
00:33:34,319 --> 00:33:35,920
I still need to learn a few tips from you.

553
00:33:38,279 --> 00:33:39,119
Let me take this call.

554
00:33:39,119 --> 00:33:39,759
Sure, go ahead.

555
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:47,599
Who is it?

556
00:33:47,599 --> 00:33:49,480
Captain, I'm out.

557
00:33:49,839 --> 00:33:50,640
Wei Tian.

558
00:33:51,799 --> 00:33:53,200
Where are you? I'll come find you.

559
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:55,160
I'll send you the address in a bit.

560
00:33:55,920 --> 00:33:57,200
Go find Grace first.

561
00:33:57,599 --> 00:33:59,400
How did Grace get dragged into this?

562
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,559
You'll know once you see her.

563
00:34:35,639 --> 00:34:37,679
What I just gave you was the cheap stuff.

564
00:34:38,519 --> 00:34:40,519
This is what you really need.

565
00:34:40,639 --> 00:34:41,920
It'll keep you sharp,

566
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:44,719
and leave you craving more, addicted.

567
00:35:00,039 --> 00:35:00,840
Hold on!

568
00:35:02,519 --> 00:35:04,840
You guys, go seal off the factory exits!

569
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:06,199
Report the situation over there.

570
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:07,760
Move, move!

571
00:35:11,639 --> 00:35:12,519
What's that noise?

572
00:35:29,239 --> 00:35:30,920
One guy took over our warehouse.

573
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,199
He kicked all of us out.

574
00:35:32,199 --> 00:35:33,239
That explosion just now...

575
00:35:33,239 --> 00:35:35,159
did it come from the drug warehouse?

576
00:35:35,159 --> 00:35:35,960
Sounds like it.

577
00:35:37,679 --> 00:35:38,480
Oh, God.

578
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:44,360
Wei Tian escaped!

579
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:45,719
What?

580
00:35:46,239 --> 00:35:47,039
Stop the car!

581
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,599
Wei Tian escaped.

582
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,840
He torched our base's lab

583
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:58,159
and the drug warehouse.

584
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:01,880
Did you find him?

585
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:04,159
He headed outside the base.

586
00:36:04,159 --> 00:36:05,719
Our men are chasing him.

587
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:08,960
All right, I'm heading back. Don't let him get away!

588
00:36:09,159 --> 00:36:09,960
Copy that.

589
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,280
Hurry up! Back to the base!

590
00:36:21,079 --> 00:36:21,880
Consul Wu.

591
00:36:22,239 --> 00:36:24,480
For refugees who lost passports and need new ones,

592
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:25,679
I've registered them all.

593
00:36:25,679 --> 00:36:26,320
In addition,

594
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:28,320
some overseas Chinese want to return home,

595
00:36:28,519 --> 00:36:29,760
but need their visas processed.

596
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:31,320
Some compatriots from Hong Kong, Macao, and Taiwan

597
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,920
also hope to board our chartered flight,

598
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:35,480
but they need some documents reissued.

599
00:36:38,199 --> 00:36:39,400
Then let's set up

600
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:41,320
a temporary office at the hotel

601
00:36:41,519 --> 00:36:42,519
and expedite these special cases.

602
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:44,599
Our embassies and consulates abroad

603
00:36:45,079 --> 00:36:47,960
are meant to serve our fellow citizens.

604
00:36:48,239 --> 00:36:49,039
Understood.

605
00:36:52,239 --> 00:36:53,039
Here you go.

606
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,199
Thank you.

607
00:36:56,039 --> 00:36:56,840
Here.

608
00:36:57,119 --> 00:36:57,920
Thank you.

609
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,400
Here.

610
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:02,159
Shen Yu.

611
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:03,679
President An.

612
00:37:03,679 --> 00:37:05,880
You haven't rested since you got back.

613
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:06,960
Have you eaten?

614
00:37:07,519 --> 00:37:08,960
You haven't eaten either, President An.

615
00:37:08,960 --> 00:37:10,480
How could we slack off?

616
00:37:10,639 --> 00:37:12,320
But you're working much harder than us.

617
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:15,519
Actually, no matter when,

618
00:37:15,639 --> 00:37:17,519
as long as you care about our people, that's enough.

619
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,239
Here you go.

620
00:37:20,239 --> 00:37:20,760
Thank you.

621
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,480
President An,

622
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:24,480
here's the Type B plasma the patient needs.

623
00:37:25,039 --> 00:37:26,159
Then take it over right away.

624
00:37:26,159 --> 00:37:28,239
Later, notify Xiao Chuan and Yang Di

625
00:37:28,239 --> 00:37:29,320
that there will be a management meeting.

626
00:37:33,159 --> 00:37:35,360
You're doing a great job as manager, President An.

627
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:37,280
Just doing my duty.

628
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:38,760
I'll go get things organized.

629
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,519
All right.

630
00:37:39,519 --> 00:37:40,320
Wait, wait.

631
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:42,280
Remember to eat something.

632
00:37:42,719 --> 00:37:43,519
I'm not hungry.

633
00:37:43,519 --> 00:37:43,800
Take it.

634
00:37:43,800 --> 00:37:44,960
Give it to someone who needs it.

635
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:50,000
The evacuation plane

636
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:52,400
will be landing at the Antilocaris airport

637
00:37:52,440 --> 00:37:53,239
very soon.

638
00:37:53,239 --> 00:37:55,000
We need to get the vehicles ready.

639
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:57,320
Yang Di, please help me arrange that.

640
00:37:57,480 --> 00:37:59,920
An Da, these compatriots...

641
00:38:00,239 --> 00:38:01,880
They've been eating our food and sleeping here,

642
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:03,480
and we haven't charged them a single cent.

643
00:38:03,880 --> 00:38:06,079
Now we even have to arrange cars to send them off?

644
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:08,800
I've already applied to Zhong'an.

645
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:11,159
We'll escort our compatriots to the airport together.

646
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,480
It's very dangerous outside right now.

647
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:13,599
If something happens,

648
00:38:13,599 --> 00:38:14,559
what are we going to do?

649
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:19,400
But we don't have that many cars right now.

650
00:38:19,519 --> 00:38:21,559
Enough, Yang Di. No "buts."

651
00:38:21,559 --> 00:38:22,719
These are extraordinary times.

652
00:38:22,719 --> 00:38:23,920
We must find a way.

653
00:38:24,159 --> 00:38:24,920
Do whatever it takes.

654
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:26,199
Whether we borrow or rent them,

655
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:29,000
we must get these citizens safely relocated.

656
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:29,679
All right.

657
00:38:30,079 --> 00:38:31,320
Do you all know?

658
00:38:31,679 --> 00:38:33,400
We should actually all thank An Da.

659
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:35,079
Her decisive actions

660
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:37,320
have earned our hotel a great reputation.

661
00:38:37,880 --> 00:38:39,119
All the media back home

662
00:38:39,119 --> 00:38:40,440
have practically run front-page headlines

663
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:41,760
covering our hotel.

664
00:38:42,199 --> 00:38:43,719
Don't you check the news back home?

665
00:38:44,199 --> 00:38:46,079
Come on, let me read it to you.

666
00:38:47,599 --> 00:38:48,480
Look here.

667
00:38:49,639 --> 00:38:51,079
This is the latest report:

668
00:38:52,119 --> 00:38:54,760
"Ever since civil war erupted in Antilocaris,

669
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:57,480
a large number of Chinese citizens

670
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:59,400
have lost their homes and been displaced.

671
00:38:59,559 --> 00:39:01,239
While fleeing the flames of war,

672
00:39:01,239 --> 00:39:02,559
they have all invariably

673
00:39:02,559 --> 00:39:04,280
sought refuge at a Chinese enterprise:

674
00:39:04,599 --> 00:39:06,199
our Grand Plato Hotel.

675
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:09,239
Because our Grand Plato Hotel

676
00:39:09,239 --> 00:39:12,320
unconditionally took in these many citizens,

677
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:14,119
opened its lobby

678
00:39:14,119 --> 00:39:16,880
to shelter those with nowhere to go,

679
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:18,920
and provided free food and bedding,

680
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:21,960
it has earned high praise from Chinese in Africa."

681
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,559
So we really should thank An Da.

682
00:39:24,559 --> 00:39:25,760
Thanks to what she did,

683
00:39:25,760 --> 00:39:29,119
our hotel has been hailed as an industry model.

684
00:39:30,719 --> 00:39:31,920
I think all of us

685
00:39:32,039 --> 00:39:33,679
should learn from her.

686
00:39:35,559 --> 00:39:36,360
By the way, An Da,

687
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:39,280
I've had several calls from reporters

688
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:41,920
asking for an in-depth interview with you.

689
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:43,079
Get yourself ready.

690
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:44,880
An interview, too?

691
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,599
An Da, you're amazing!

692
00:39:46,599 --> 00:39:48,360
Not at all, it's thanks to everyone.

693
00:39:51,199 --> 00:39:53,320
We have received confirmed news.

694
00:39:53,719 --> 00:39:56,320
The first chartered flight from home

695
00:39:57,280 --> 00:39:59,599
will arrive on schedule tonight.

696
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:03,800
After the crew and aircraft rest a bit,

697
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:05,159
at 10:00 AM tomorrow,

698
00:40:05,199 --> 00:40:07,159
it can depart for home right on time.

699
00:40:08,280 --> 00:40:11,320
The situation in Antilocaris

700
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,679
is still quite volatile.

701
00:40:13,119 --> 00:40:14,320
Security along the route

702
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:16,920
will be up to Zhong'an.

703
00:40:17,639 --> 00:40:18,800
Rest assured, Consul Wu.

704
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:20,400
We guarantee mission success.

705
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:23,000
Don't worry, just leave it to Shen Yu and me.

706
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:24,320
Let me come along, too.

707
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:26,920
No, Helen. Stay here and assist An Da.

708
00:40:27,119 --> 00:40:28,880
Right, you stay at the hotel.

709
00:40:28,920 --> 00:40:31,280
We can't let our guard down here yet.

710
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:34,639
Besides, the injured compatriots at the hotel

711
00:40:34,639 --> 00:40:35,960
still need your care.

712
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:36,639
Right.

713
00:40:36,639 --> 00:40:38,960
It'll be enough for me, Shen Yu, and Captain to go.

714
00:40:39,880 --> 00:40:41,920
Where's Captain? I haven't seen him.

715
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:43,760
Yeah, I was wondering that too.

716
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:17,559
Grace sent you?

717
00:41:19,519 --> 00:41:21,199
Grace asked me to give you this.

718
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:24,280
Why didn't Grace come in person?

719
00:41:24,519 --> 00:41:26,199
You know how things are right now.

720
00:41:26,199 --> 00:41:27,719
A lot of things are complicated.

721
00:41:29,599 --> 00:41:31,000
Thanks. As usual.

722
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:31,800
No need.

723
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:34,000
Grace said once you're done,

724
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:36,280
come to the New World for some drinks.

725
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:38,480
Will do. Thanks.

726
00:41:39,039 --> 00:41:39,840
See you.

727
00:41:39,920 --> 00:41:40,760
Goodbye.

728
00:41:58,760 --> 00:42:01,159
Wei Tian hasn't forgotten our promise.

729
00:42:04,239 --> 00:42:06,760
Captain, you said Rossi went to Libania,

730
00:42:06,800 --> 00:42:08,880
and you returned to Antilocaris to find me.

731
00:42:08,880 --> 00:42:09,559
Is that right?

732
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:11,519
Right. Between Rossi and me,

733
00:42:11,519 --> 00:42:13,679
one of us had to come help you.

734
00:42:13,679 --> 00:42:16,719
Don't think about playing the lone wolf this time.

735
00:42:17,239 --> 00:42:18,039
Alright.

736
00:42:19,039 --> 00:42:20,360
I've got a plan.

737
00:42:20,880 --> 00:42:21,719
What plan?

738
00:42:22,679 --> 00:42:24,679
In Antilocaris, Hades

739
00:42:25,239 --> 00:42:26,559
has deployed so many men,

740
00:42:27,079 --> 00:42:28,880
relentlessly hunting down the King and me.

741
00:42:29,519 --> 00:42:30,599
I'll find an opportunity

742
00:42:32,039 --> 00:42:33,119
to let him capture me.

743
00:42:33,159 --> 00:42:34,159
You're crazy!

744
00:42:34,519 --> 00:42:36,199
He's dying to find you right now!

745
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:38,199
If we don't locate the drug lab

746
00:42:38,639 --> 00:42:39,840
and stop the foreign forces

747
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:41,159
backing Hades from wreaking havoc,

748
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,360
we don't deserve to be Silent Protectors.

749
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:45,920
I think I know what you're trying to do.

750
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:48,000
But let me tell you,

751
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:49,760
doing this is extremely dangerous.

752
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:51,119
Don't worry.

753
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:54,199
I'll keep a clear head at all times

754
00:42:54,199 --> 00:42:55,360
and stay in touch with you.

755
00:42:56,119 --> 00:42:59,679
Hopefully we can seize this opportunity.

756
00:43:00,159 --> 00:43:00,920
Wait for me.

757
00:43:27,079 --> 00:43:28,320
Take the high ground.

758
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:29,000
Copy.
